{"title":"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 29","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_29&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The minimum value of a positive integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" />, for which the sum <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/7/2f72ea91dbc2764a741f855168ba3294d4e49c2c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\displaystyle S=k+(k+1)+(k+2)+\\ldots+(k+10)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"330\" height=\"18\" /> is a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Perfect_square\" title=\"Perfect square\">perfect square</a>, is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/b/d3ba988d59ad5a6519737916049a60a7e19a303b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A) \\ } 5\\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ } 6\\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\ } 10\\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\ } 11\\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\ } \\mathrm{None\\;of\\;these}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"458\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_29&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/1/6410fa605d51ed01e6d664d81d94ec1dd0ae68d0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\displaystyle k+(k+1)+(k+2)+\\ldots+(k+10)=11k+55=11(k+5)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"485\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/7/b275d93588c842b76049f8b5daf4ebae434f169e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k+5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"41\" height=\"14\" /> must be divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/8/c6878713578626763c38433b3f4c8c2205ad0c15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, and the minimum for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/7/b776bf9ee5700b3e60c1321fbf9c9f8dd55f7ace.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{ B}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"60\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_29&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; align:center; width:60%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum\">2007 Cyprus MO, Lyceum</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problems\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problems\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_28\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 28\">Problem 28</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_30\" title=\"2007